package Libraries.Concurrency

/*
    A queue of text that any thread can add to, while one thread takes all of
    it at once. The Console uses it: program output arrives on reader threads,
    and the main thread puts it in the text box each frame.

    AddClear puts a clear mark in the queue. RemoveAll drops the text before
    the last mark, and WasCleared then returns true.
*/
class ConcurrentTextQueue
    system action Add(text value)
    system action AddClear
    system action RemoveAll returns text
    system action WasCleared returns boolean
    system action IsEmpty returns boolean
    system action Empty
end
